6"},{"short_id":"nld6x3","created_at":"2026-11-11T07:13:51.549-06:00","title":"What are some \"No AI\" apps/companies/resources you know of?","url":"","score":89,"flags":1,"comment_count":40,"description":"\u003cp\u003eHey everyone I'm wondering if there's any useful/helpful list of apps, companies, or resources in general that avoid AI (they don't have to be vocally or openly \"anti\", but at least explicitly avoid it) that you know of?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI'm not looking to start a discussion on what's good/bad or (un)worthy about AI, or who's for/against, just links and/or communities promoting this sentiment/position.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor example, \u003ca href=\"https://www.rebeltechalliance.org\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://www.rebeltechalliance.org\u003c/a\u003e would be one of those resources.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you!\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"Hey everyone I'm wondering if there's any useful/helpful list of apps, companies, or resources in general that avoid AI (they don't have to be vocally or openly \"anti\", but at least explicitly avoid it) that you know of?\r\n\r\nI'm not looking to start a discussion on what's good/bad or (un)worthy about AI, or who's for/against, just links and/or communities promoting this sentiment/position.\r\n\r\nFor example, https://www.rebeltechalliance.org would be one of those resources.\r\n\r\nThank you!","submitter_user":"brn","user_is_author":true,"tags":["ask"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/nld6x3","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/nld6x3/what_are_some_no_ai_apps_companies"}]